<title>USA: HEICO Corp Q4 net, share increases.</title>
<headline>HEICO Corp Q4 net, share increases.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Fla. 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Twelve Months    For the Three Months</p>
<p>				Ended			  Ended</p>
<p>		     10/31/96     10/31/95    10/31/96   10/31/95</p>
<p>Net sales from</p>
<p>continuing</p>
<p> operations   $34,565,000  $25,613,000 $11,586,000 $6,923,000</p>
<p> Net income     9,892,000    2,695,000   1,387,000    753,000</p>
<p>Net income per share</p>
<p>			   1.84	    .56	   .25	  .15</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p> shares (2)     5,366,501    4,820,336   5,518,425  5,022,098</p>
<p>NOTE: (2) Information has been adjusted to give effect to stock splits and stock dividends paid.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
